00:12:16.327 --> 00:12:18.127
♪ Pin it, but update for patches. ♪

216
00:12:18.127 --> 00:12:23.867
♪ External reuse is not a one-time investment. ♪

217
00:12:25.067 --> 00:12:31.009
(narrator) The outro: your hero steps forward on the brick site, singing beside a terminal that shows npm install left-pad.

218
00:12:31.009 --> 00:12:36.314
(narrator) The command is deleted and replaced by String of str dot padStart: eleven lines become one built-in.

219
00:12:36.314 --> 00:12:43.847
(narrator) Directly over the site, five case bricks stack into one build: reuse done right, and the foreman, carrying a gold brick, gives it a thumbs-up.

220
00:12:43.847 --> 00:12:47.243
(narrator) Behind it, the crane sets its prebuilt module onto the building.

221
00:12:47.243 --> 00:12:49.789
(narrator) The sun has risen to the right into golden hour.

222
00:12:49.789 --> 00:12:55.147
(narrator) The upper sky is bright blue, the horizon glows gold, and the clouds have peach and cream undersides.

223
00:12:55.147 --> 00:12:57.057
(narrator) The stars and site lamps have faded.

224
00:12:57.647 --> 00:13:00.247
npm install left-pad?

225
00:13:00.247 --> 00:13:04.747
No need: padStart is built in.

226
00:13:05.337 --> 00:13:08.187
That's reuse done right.

227
00:13:08.187 --> 00:13:15.333
[music]
